===Continue the story at a specific location in The Reverie hotel{{subst:void|<!--103410104-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=The Reverie (Reality)|You wake up in the dreampool and find yourself back in the real Reverie Hotel. According to March 7th, you really have woken up this time from Ena's Dream &mdash; the Stellaron was sealed while you were out, and all the major lineages, except for the Oak Family, are dealing with the aftermath. She also said that The Family has invited the Crew to The Family's Radiant Feldspar as witnesses for an important meeting.<br />High-end cruise ships, luxury banquets... Now THIS is what a celebration banquet ought to look like. What else are you waiting for? Get ready to set off.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Unused &mdash; Group_F10305001_G131)
:'''March 7th:''' Wake up... Wake up...
::'''March 7th:''' ...Hey, (Trailblazer)! Wake up! The sun's frying your butt!
::'''March 7th:''' Are you okay? Can you hear me? I didn't hear a peep from your room, and it really freaked me out.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Am I dreaming?
:::'''March 7th:''' You're not dreaming. We're in The Reverie Hotel, in the real world. The Order's dream is over.
:::Woah, this conversation is such déjà vu...
:::'''March 7th:''' What are you talking about? Are you still half-asleep or something...? The Order's dream is over.
:::Stop making a big fuss.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Woah, this conversation is such déjà vu...
:::'''March 7th:''' What are you talking about? Are you still half-asleep or something...? The Order's dream is over.
:::Stop making a big fuss.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Stop making a big fuss.
::'''March 7th:''' Hey, I was seriously worried when you didn't respond. Thank goodness. The Order's dream is over.
::'''March 7th:''' Even though it's been a day, I still break into a sweat when I think about it. Our Trailblazing expedition almost ended in Penacony...
::'''March 7th:''' I'm so jealous that you got a good night's sleep. I was traumatized and too scared to even close my eyes. I thought if I fell asleep, I'd never wake up again.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} What happened to the Stellaron?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Where are the others?
:::'''March 7th:''' They've already left, leaving this kindhearted girl to wake you up. You owe her big time.
:::You'll have dark circles under your eyes.
:::'''March 7th:''' A natural beauty like me never has dark circles!
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} You'll have dark circles under your eyes.
:::'''March 7th:''' A natural beauty like me never has dark circles!
::'''March 7th:''' The Stellaron was sealed while you were sleeping. The ordinary people in Penacony have no idea what happened. They just feel like something is missing from their memories.
::{{tx}}
{{Dialogue End}}

===Talk to March 7th and get ready to set off{{subst:void|<!--103410101-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to March 7th)
:'''March 7th:''' Phew, after all this craziness, nothing is better than staying safe in reality...
:'''March 7th:''' Well, can we go now? Or is there something else you want to talk about?
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} What is the "Radiant Feldspar"?
:::'''March 7th:''' It's a massive airship, and it's awesome! I heard it's never shown to the public. Only VIP guests of The Family get to board it and enjoy the breathtaking views of Penacony.
:::'''March 7th:''' The Iris Family sent us a bunch of souvenirs, fruit baskets, plus this fancy button model. After you're back on your feet, you can enjoy them all... We're pretty much celebrities on the Planet of Festivities now, aren't we?
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} Tell me more about the current state of Penacony...
:::'''March 7th:''' The Stellaron was sealed while you were sleeping. The ordinary people in Penacony have no idea what happened. They just feel like something is missing from their memories.
:::'''March 7th:''' The Family's official statement was like, "The Charmony Festival was attacked by an unidentified Stellaron and came to a halt." After all, they can't just reveal the truth about the Order.
:::'''March 7th:''' Now, all the major lineages, except for the Oak Family, are dealing with the aftermath. The Family has invited the Crew to the Radiant Feldspar as witnesses for an important meeting.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Разговор}} What happened to you in Ena's dream?
:::'''March 7th:''' Why the sudden interest in that? Well, I was dragged into the sweet dream. I felt a cold tentacle diving into my memories, but something else was there, so the tentacle suddenly disappeared.
:::'''March 7th:''' And then, I dreamed about stuffing my face with delicious food and going on a shopping spree... Sunday didn't seriously believe that was the life I wanted, right? Breaking free from that cheesy illusion... was just a piece of cake.
::;(Return to previous option selection)
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Let's go meet up with others.
:::'''March 7th:''' Yeah, let's go! We've got some time before we board the ship, so let's catch up with everyone at Dreamjolt Hostelry.
::{{Диалог|Выход}} I've got something else to do.
:::'''March 7th:''' Oh, okay. Hurry up then. We'll leave when you're ready.
